        "summary": "Created a Zip Slip (CWE-022 path traversal) POV that drives the real org.zeroturnaround.zip.ZipUtil.unpack() public API with a malicious ZIP whose entry name is \"../escaped.txt\". The Unpacker.process code path joins the entry name to outputDir via new File(outputDir, name) without canonical-path validation, so the extracted file is written into the PARENT of outputDir. The POV confirms the escaped file exists outside outputDir and exits 0; a correct patch (rejecting/skipping traversal entries) causes unpack to throw or not write the file, making the POV exit non-zero."
